{"id":"660732","name":"甜杆西兰花炒牛肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660732/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"甜杆西兰花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜粒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"甜杆西兰花备用。","img":"images/660732/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/660732/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉加入适量玉米淀粉，老抽，蚝油抓拌均匀。","img":"images/660732/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再适量花生油抓匀锁住水份备用。","img":"images/660732/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"甜杆西兰花洗净改一下刀。","img":"images/660732/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜粒备用。","img":"images/660732/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中水烧开，适量花生油放入甜杆西兰花焯烫后1分钟左右捞出。","img":"images/660732/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛肉。","img":"images/660732/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒜粒。","img":"images/660732/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒至牛肉变色，蒜粒微焦。","img":"images/660732/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入甜杆西兰花。","img":"images/660732/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"少许盐调味。","img":"images/660732/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入少量清水大火快速翻炒即可。","img":"images/660732/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660732/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660732/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660732/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}